        ("segments", "customer", "03 / CUSTOMER INTELLIGENCE", "Unsupervised learning", "The patterns inside the basket.", "Finding spend-based customer groups, then checking whether the boundaries survive resampling and outlier removal.", f'{S["bootstrap_ari_median"]:.2f}', "median bootstrap agreement (ARI)")
